      "question": "---- Ms. Uribe was promoted to director of development at Cranhurst International, she served in many other capacities.",
      "choices": [
        "Before",
        "Instead",
        "Likewise",
        "Consequently"
      ],
      "answer": "A",
      "difficulty": "easy",
      "topic": "时间连词",
      "keywords": "before promoted conjunction",
      "answer_explain": "空格后 Ms. Uribe was promoted 是完整从句，Before 表示此前担任其他职务，时间关系清楚。Instead、Likewise、Consequently 都是副词或连接副词，不能像 before 一样直接引导这个从句。",
      "question_type": "语法题",
      "choice_translations": [
        "在……之前",
        "代替；反而",
        "同样地；也",
        "因此；所以"
      ],
      "explanation_structured": {
